║  ETL 2026-2 — Health Colombia ODS 3 (batch + streaming)  ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

Python:  Python 3.12.14
uv:      uv 0.11.21 (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu)
podman:  podman version 5.8.6
psql:    psql (PostgreSQL)

Quick start (paso a paso completo en README.md):
  cp .env.example .env                          # configuración local
  podman-compose up -d                          # postgres+airflow+superset+kafka+streaming
  podman-compose run --rm etl python -m src.etl_main   # ETL batch manual
  pytest -q                                     # suite de tests
  python -m src.streaming.producer --mode replay --loop # simular eventos
  python -m scripts.streaming_demo --listen 5   # ver eventos del topic
  open http://localhost:8080 (Airflow) · 8088 (Superset) · 8501 (tiempo real)

Extras:  uv pip install <pkg>  ·  jupyter lab  ·  kcat -L -b localhost:19092

